msgid "Minesweeper-like Game"
msgstr "Igra nalik Minolovcu"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kmines.appdata.xml:12
msgid "KMines is a classic Minesweeper game. The idea is to uncover all the squares without blowing up any mines. When a mine is blown up, the game is over."
msgstr "KMines je klasična igra Minolovac. Cilj je otkriti sva polja bez aktiviranja mina. Ako se aktivira mina, igra završava."